id: goop-throw
name: Goop Throw
talentCategory: racial
race: majin
prerequisites: Majin, Primordial Majin Factor
description: >
  Throw your Goop at an Opponent!
text: >
  Goop Throw: Throw your Goop at an Opponent!
  –Prerequisites: Majin, Primordial Majin Factor
  (1)-[Passive]: Your Goop can use the Grapple Maneuver.
  (2)-[Passive]: Increase the Magnitude for the 5th effect of From Goop by 1.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If a Goop is created on a Square adjacent to an Opponent, that Goop may use the Grapple Maneuver as an Out-of-Sequence Maneuver.

